{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Tapes of Fear: Smile",
    "steam_appid": 2023540,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023540/extras/514c5ad796f6ac69dc1af41aeea0a5a2.avif?t=1753811333\" /></div><br><br><i><strong>Tapes of Fear: Smile</strong></i> was created with one goal: to cause as much fear as possible. This first-person psychological horror game guarantees a unique and terrifying experience with each gameplay.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023540/extras/cee6dea4614e438cd74ee1acb6f1dcdd.avif?t=1753811333\" /></div><br><br>At the heart of <i>Tapes of Fear</i> is the innovative <strong>Infinity Fear System\u2122</strong>, a technology created by Infinity Green Game Studio. Developed based on academic studies on how to induce fear, this advanced system monitors your decisions and reactions in real-time, dynamically adjusting game events to maximize terror. The system ensures you never face too many or too few scares, maintaining a perfect flow of terror. Every decision and reaction alters the course of events, providing a new and terrifying experience with each playthrough.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023540/extras/5a055602ff5b53290257d6c03be3ef92.poster.avif?t=1753811333\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023540/extras/5a055602ff5b53290257d6c03be3ef92.webm?t=1753811333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023540/extras/5a055602ff5b53290257d6c03be3ef92.mp4?t=1753811333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SMILE</h2><br>You are not alone in the strange house where you wake up trapped. A dark entity, always with a sinister smile, uses ducts to move between the walls, relentlessly hunting you. This enemy is relentless and adaptive, making each encounter a battle for survival. Its constant presence keeps you on high alert, and your character is entirely defenseless, forcing you to use your wits and agility to avoid being found.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023540/extras/0a1adc965439f62a646745fefd6802c3.poster.avif?t=1753811333\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023540/extras/0a1adc965439f62a646745fefd6802c3.webm?t=1753811333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023540/extras/0a1adc965439f62a646745fefd6802c3.mp4?t=1753811333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SANITY</h2><br>Maintaining your sanity is essential to survive in <i>Tapes of Fear</i>. The house is filled with disturbing events that affect your character both psychologically and physically. Find, use, and manage items that help keep your sanity stable.<br><br><strong>Prepare for a journey that will challenge your mind and courage in <i>Tapes of Fear</i>. Each playthrough is a new experience of terror, ensuring you never know exactly what to expect.</strong>",
    "about_the_game": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023540/extras/514c5ad796f6ac69dc1af41aeea0a5a2.avif?t=1753811333\" /></div><br><br><i><strong>Tapes of Fear: Smile</strong></i> was created with one goal: to cause as much fear as possible. This first-person psychological horror game guarantees a unique and terrifying experience with each gameplay.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023540/extras/cee6dea4614e438cd74ee1acb6f1dcdd.avif?t=1753811333\" /></div><br><br>At the heart of <i>Tapes of Fear</i> is the innovative <strong>Infinity Fear System\u2122</strong>, a technology created by Infinity Green Game Studio. Developed based on academic studies on how to induce fear, this advanced system monitors your decisions and reactions in real-time, dynamically adjusting game events to maximize terror. The system ensures you never face too many or too few scares, maintaining a perfect flow of terror. Every decision and reaction alters the course of events, providing a new and terrifying experience with each playthrough.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023540/extras/5a055602ff5b53290257d6c03be3ef92.poster.avif?t=1753811333\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023540/extras/5a055602ff5b53290257d6c03be3ef92.webm?t=1753811333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023540/extras/5a055602ff5b53290257d6c03be3ef92.mp4?t=1753811333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SMILE</h2><br>You are not alone in the strange house where you wake up trapped. A dark entity, always with a sinister smile, uses ducts to move between the walls, relentlessly hunting you. This enemy is relentless and adaptive, making each encounter a battle for survival. Its constant presence keeps you on high alert, and your character is entirely defenseless, forcing you to use your wits and agility to avoid being found.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023540/extras/0a1adc965439f62a646745fefd6802c3.poster.avif?t=1753811333\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023540/extras/0a1adc965439f62a646745fefd6802c3.webm?t=1753811333\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2023540/extras/0a1adc965439f62a646745fefd6802c3.mp4?t=1753811333\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">SANITY</h2><br>Maintaining your sanity is essential to survive in <i>Tapes of Fear</i>. The house is filled with disturbing events that affect your character both psychologically and physically. Find, use, and manage items that help keep your sanity stable.<br><br><strong>Prepare for a journey that will challenge your mind and courage in <i>Tapes of Fear</i>. Each playthrough is a new experience of terror, ensuring you never know exactly what to expect.</strong>",
    "short_description": "Based on the classics of psychological horror, Tapes of Fear introduces the Infinity Fear System\u2122: a technology that analyzes your actions, recognizes your fears, and triggers events when you least expect it. Experience a suffocating, unpredictable game that truly knows how to scare you.",
